ct: business names and addresses, PAN and VAT numbers, customer and supplier details, products and prices, invoices, purchases, payments, expenses, income, cash and bank entries, and the resulting ledgers and reports. This information belongs to you. We process it to provide the service to you."}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Payment information"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"When you buy a subscription, the payment is handled by a licensed payment provider (for example eSewa, Khalti or Fonepay). We receive a reference, the amount, the status and the plan purchased. We do not receive or store your full wallet credentials or bank details."}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Device, technical and usage information"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Device model, operating system version, app version, language, time zone, IP address, crash and diagnostic logs, and information about how features are used. We also store push notification tokens so we can deliver notifications to your devices."}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Communications"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Messages you send to our support team, and records of the reminders and notifications the system sends on your behalf, including delivery status. Where you use SMS features, we store the content of messages sent through the service and their delivery outcome."}]]}]]}],["$","section","how-we-use-it",{"id":"how-we-use-it","className":"scroll-mt-24 pb-12","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"display-sm flex gap-4 text-[22px] sm:text-[26px]","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"tnum text-brand","children":"03"}],"How we use your information"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"legal-body text-ink-soft mt-5 space-y-4 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed","children":[["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":"To create and secure your account, and to verify you when you sign in."}],"$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24","$L25","$L26","$L27","$L28"]}],"$L29"]}]]}],"$L2a","$L2b","$L2c","$L2d","$L2e","$L2f","$L30","$L31","$L32